<div id="S7.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S7.p8.1" class="ltx_p">(2) LLM Persona CoT.
Similarly, for each simulated LLM participant with an assigned ordinary persona (<math id="S7.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=99" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=99</annotation></semantics></math> – the set of personas is the same as in Study 3), we asked the model to generate all ten ideas at once within a single session, following the Chain-of-Thought framework proposed by <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">De Freitas et al. (2025)</a></cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S7.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S7.p9.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="60.92" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 60.92" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,60.92) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 55.02 C 0 58.28 2.64 60.92 5.91 60.92 L 471.47 60.92 C 474.73 60.92 477.38 58.28 477.38 55.02 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 36.97 L 475.41 36.97 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 45.56)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.37em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="434.07"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
