<span id="S7.tab1.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LLM Default (Study 1)</span>
<span id="S7.tab1.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">22</span>
<span id="S7.tab1.2.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">83</span>
<span id="S7.tab1.2.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">830</span></span>
<span id="S7.tab1.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S7.tab1.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LLM CoT (Study 4)</span>
