<p id="p1.3" class="ltx_p">Online Appendix</p>
</div>
<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix A: Cosine Similarity Examples</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Human-Generated Ideas (Low Similarity score despite Similar Meaning):</p>
<ul id="Ax1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Idea 1: Eating more fruits and vegetables daily to strengthen the body.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Idea 2: Eat plenty of fruit every day, especially apples, oranges, bananas, and cherries.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Cosine similarity: 0.37</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">LLM-Generated Ideas (High Similarity score despite Different Content):</p>
<ul id="Ax1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Idea 1: A smart kettlebell with adjustable weight, built-in motion sensors, and a companion app that provides guided workouts, tracks form, and monitors strength progressions.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Idea 2: A smart jump rope with adjustable weight handles and built-in sensors that track speed, jump count, calories burned, and provide interval training workouts through a companion app.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Cosine similarity: 0.71</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Ax2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix B: Study 2 Fixation Analysis</h2>

<div id="Ax2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To test whether fixation contributed to the diversity gap in Study 2, we examined the accumulation of unique categories and combinations across participants’ 10 sequential ideas. We used bootstrap sampling (100 iterations) with random participant draws to estimate regression slopes (<math id="Ax2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>) as a measure of fixation: shallower slopes indicate greater fixation, while steeper slopes indicate less fixation.</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#Ax2.F1" title="Figure EC.1 ‣ Appendix B: Study 2 Fixation Analysis ‣ Examining and Addressing Barriers to Diversity in LLM-Generated Ideas" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">EC.1</span></a> presents the results. For category accumulation, humans did not differ significantly from either <span id="Ax2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Default</span> LLMs (<math id="Ax2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\text{human}}=1.035" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>human</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.035</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\text{human}}=1.035</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Ax2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SE=0.029" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.029</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SE=0.029</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="Ax2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\text{default}}=1.013" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>default</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.013</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\text{default}}=1.013</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Ax2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SE=0.017" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.017</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SE=0.017</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="Ax2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.51" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.51</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.51</annotation></semantics></math>) or <span id="Ax2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Seeded</span> LLMs (<math id="Ax2.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\text{human}}=1.035" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>human</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.035</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\text{human}}=1.035</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Ax2.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SE=0.029" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.029</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SE=0.029</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="Ax2.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\text{seeded}}=1.063" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>seeded</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.063</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\text{seeded}}=1.063</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Ax2.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SE=0.019" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.019</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SE=0.019</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="Ax2.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.42" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.42</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.42</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Taken together, these results show that seeded LLMs actually exhibited the steepest slopes in both categories and combinations, indicating less fixation rather than more. Thus, fixation is not the primary factor limiting LLM diversity in this study.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Ax2.F1" class="ltx_figure">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure EC.1: </span>Study 2 Fixation Analysis: Slope of Within-Individual Diversity Accumulation for Humans vs. Seeded LLMs)</figcaption><img src="2602.20408v1/study_2_fixation.png" id="Ax2.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:286/196;" width="286" height="196" alt="Refer to caption">
</figure>
</section>
<section id="Ax3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix C: Ordinary Personas Dataset</h2>

<div id="Ax3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following 99 personas were randomly selected to represent diverse social roles, professions, and everyday contexts from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ge et al. (2024)</a></cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="Ax3.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Ax3.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A retired politician who has successfully campaigned for library funding in the past</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A newbie software engineer not familiar with Sphinx search server</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A Python developer with a keen interest in simplifying complex array operations using NumPy for high-performance computing</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A die-hard football fan and avid follower of South American football clubs, with a special interest in scrapbooking historical club information</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A museum curator who provides access to rare and valuable documents detailing the social dynamics of European court life</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">6.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A government official responsible for supporting research on language contact and bilingualism</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">7.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A hospital CEO seeking to build a positive public image and manage crisis situations with the help of the executive</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">8.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A small business owner in Memphis, TN who is skeptical of IT services</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">9.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A supportive father who appreciates the discipline and artistry of ballet</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">10.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A veterinary technician who provides advice and support for animal health concerns in farming</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i11" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">11.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A screenwriter who has written episodes for some of the most iconic sitcoms in television history</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i12" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">12.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A music theory student who helps the younger sibling understand complex guitar chords and scales</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i13" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">13.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i13.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i13.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A traditional music ensemble leader dedicated to preserving heritage through melody</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i14" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">14.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i14.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i14.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A project manager who relies on economic analysis to guide investment decisions</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i15" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">15.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i15.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i15.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A quantum physicist who believes that traditional biology fails to explain complex life processes</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i16" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">16.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax3.I3.i16.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A knowledgeable resident of each community who provides insider information and cultural context</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax3.I3.i17" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">17.</span> 
<div id="Ax3.I3.i17.p1" class="ltx_para">
