<li id="Ax4.I4.i14" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">14.</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.i14.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.i14.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Jean-Luc Diard: HOKA co-founder, popularized maximalist running shoes</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax4.I4.i15" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">15.</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.i15.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.i15.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Caspar Coppetti: On Running co-founder, reimagined running shoes with cloud cushioning</p>
