<p id="Ax4.I4.i16.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Greg Glassman: CrossFit founder, built a global functional fitness movement</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax4.I4.i17" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">17.</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.i17.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.i17.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Elizabeth Cutler: SoulCycle co-founder, created community-driven indoor cycling</p>
