<li id="Ax4.I4.i18" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">18.</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.i18.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.i18.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Julie Rice: SoulCycle co-founder, built the boutique fitness studio model into a cultural phenomenon</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax4.I4.i19" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">19.</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.i19.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.i19.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Aubrey Marcus: Onnit founder, built a ”Total Human Optimization” fitness brand spanning supplements, functional foods, and training equipment</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax4.I4.i20" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">20.</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.i20.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.i20.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Ellen Latham: Orangetheory founder, popularized heart-rate-based interval training</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax4.I4.i21" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">21.</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.i21.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.i21.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Chris Froggatt: F45 Training founder, franchised functional group workouts globally</p>
