<li id="Ax4.I4.i23" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">23.</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.i23.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.i23.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Michael Grondahl: Planet Fitness co-founder, democratized gym access with low-cost memberships</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax4.I4.i24" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">24.</span> 
