<div id="Ax5.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax5.p5.1" class="ltx_p">(2) LLM Persona CoT Revision. For each simulated LLM participant with personas (<math id="Ax5.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=99" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=99</annotation></semantics></math>) from Study 3, we take their original set of ten sequentially generated ideas and apply the identical CoT revision procedure while reminding the model of the assigned persona.</p>
</div>
